{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e09-scene-15",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "最棘手的艺人阻力  (Why Talent Agencies Resist)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Seeing Bu Xiaogu's determination, Kaiwen and Xingzi sit down to explain why the third obstacle—signed singers and their agencies—is the hardest to overcome. Listen to their Mandarin discussion.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们接下来的一个阻力，就是艺人的阻力了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "确切来说，这方面才是最难的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "其实广告商跟电视台呢，说到底就是怕风险。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "一旦咱们改版成功的话，他们都是受益方，其实不是不能谈。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "改版之后，最难受的就是签约艺人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "在之前的节目形态里，他们戏份稳定，片酬又高，轻轻松松赚大钱。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "改版之后呢，他们就压力山大了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "收益不稳定不说，还有可能影响声誉，丢人现眼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这对经纪公司来说绝对是灾难性的，如果我是经纪人也没商量。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "现在所有的经纪公司全都抵制。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这样下去的话，十二歌王谁都请不来，就没法办下去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我跟你们说，艺人这方面我有办法了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们接下来的一个阻力，就是艺人的阻力了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The next obstacle ahead of us is resistance from the artists.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "确切来说，这方面才是最难的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Strictly speaking, this part is the hardest of all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "其实广告商跟电视台呢，说到底就是怕风险。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Honestly, advertisers and the television station are simply afraid of risk at bottom.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "一旦咱们改版成功的话，他们都是受益方，其实不是不能谈。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Once our revamp succeeds, they will all benefit, so they are not impossible to negotiate with.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "改版之后，最难受的就是签约艺人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After the revamp, the ones most uncomfortable will be the signed artists.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "在之前的节目形态里，他们戏份稳定，片酬又高，轻轻松松赚大钱。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Under the old format, their screen time was guaranteed and their fees were high, earning easy money.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "改版之后呢，他们就压力山大了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After the revamp, however, they will be under mountain-sized pressure.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "收益不稳定不说，还有可能影响声誉，丢人现眼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not only is the payoff uncertain, it might hurt their reputation and embarrass them in public.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这对经纪公司来说绝对是灾难性的，如果我是经纪人也没商量。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For talent agencies that is downright disastrous; if I were an agent, it would be non-negotiable.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "现在所有的经纪公司全都抵制。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right now every single talent agency is boycotting it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这样下去的话，十二歌王谁都请不来，就没法办下去了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If this continues, Twelve Singers will not be able to book anyone and cannot go on.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我跟你们说，艺人这方面我有办法了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me tell you both—for the artist side, I have got an idea!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "咱们接下来的一个阻力，就是艺人的阻力了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "确切来说，这方面才是最难的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "其实广告商跟电视台呢，说到底就是怕风险。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "一旦咱们改版成功的话，他们都是受益方，其实不是不能谈。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "改版之后，最难受的就是签约艺人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "在之前的节目形态里，他们戏份稳定，片酬又高，轻轻松松赚大钱。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "改版之后呢，他们就压力山大了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "收益不稳定不说，还有可能影响声誉，丢人现眼。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这对经纪公司来说绝对是灾难性的，如果我是经纪人也没商量。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "现在所有的经纪公司全都抵制。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这样下去的话，十二歌王谁都请不来，就没法办下去了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我跟你们说，艺人这方面我有办法了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Understanding why agencies fear the competitive new format gives Bu Xiaogu a sudden breakthrough idea, and she dashes out of the office. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
